@startuml
actor User
participant FE
participant BE
participant DB

User -> FE : Download file
FE -> BE : GET /file

BE -> BE : Validate JWT
BE -> DB : Fetch encrypted data
DB --> BE

BE --> FE : ciphertext + wrapped FEK

FE -> FE : Decrypt private key
FE -> FE : Unwrap FEK
FE -> FE : Decrypt file

FE -> FE : Recompute hash
FE -> FE : Compare hashes

FE --> User : File + result

@enduml